[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/the-taking-dark.png" id="3_icon"]

; The dark wizard's own spell (.ai/dark-wizard-playable.md): a hand of his dark light at the strongest in
; reach, a light that drifts home, and lanes thrown where he catches it. Darkness and Light - his own dark
; light, and the warm light he took - which no other spell carries together.
;
; BaseProjectileCount is hands a cast, each at its own quarry. BaseRange is the reach a quarry is found in
; (Player.FireTheTaking); the lanes' length and width are Area's (Player.TakingLaneLength and Width), grown
; by the AreaSize lines below, read as 1 + their sum. Written out in full, so the scaling tags add nothing.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_taking_lvl2"]
